x2f is an unofficial community tool. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or connected to Teenage Engineering.

This repository contains converter source only. It does not ship Teenage
Engineering firmware, sample content, or proprietary SDK binaries.

Building a pack requires separate checkouts of open-field and open-xy (and
open-xy's Blackfin toolchain). Those projects publish their own licenses.
Open-XY machines you point x2f at are yours to supply; only translate and
redistribute machines you have the right to use.
